(88,'F1.5','support','Front office FAQ','Ask Gemini to draft 10 FAQ entries for the HWHS front office on \'What is Gemini and why do we use it?\' The tone should match the Cougar family voice.','[]','**Front Office · Gemini FAQ**\n\n- What is Gemini? (Warm, plain-English answer)\n- Does the school see my child\'s chats? (Reassure — aggregated-only posture)\n- How can families use it at home?\n- How does it help teachers respond within 24 hours?\n- Who do I call with concerns?\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,15,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(89,'F1.5','support','Bilingual family flyer','Ask Gemini to draft a 1-page family flyer in English and Spanish introducing the HWHS AI Institute and the 24-hour response promise (WIG 1).','[]','**Family Flyer · Gemini and HWHS**\n\n- Mission line at top\n- 3 short paragraphs, 5th-grade reading level\n- 24-hour response promise called out\n- QR code placeholder for the Family Portal\n- Spanish version aligned line by line\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,16,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(90,'F1.5','support','Tutoring-time Gemini task','Ask Gemini to draft a warm-up routine a Cougar Elevate afterschool tutor can use in the first 5 minutes of a session to get students settled and thinking.','[]','**Cougar Elevate · 5-Minute Warm-Up**\n\n- Retrieval question tied to yesterday\'s lesson\n- One \'why this matters\' Cougar Way anchor\n- Choice of writing or talking\n- Bridge to today\'s CFA target\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,17,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(91,'F1.6','classroom','Sign in to Gemini with your @hwhschools.org account','Open gemini.google.com signed into your @hwhschools.org Workspace account. Ask Gemini: \'You are a human-in-the-loop coach for a Helena West Helena Schools teacher. Explain how to keep an HWHS educator as the final signer on every AI-assisted artifact in 5 short paragraphs I can read in one CTM Wednesday planning block.\' Then paste your response into a fresh Google Doc titled \'My Gemini Baseline\'.','[\"gemini\",\"hwhs\",\"ctm\",\"baseline\"]','**Gemini · human-in-the-loop Baseline for HWHS**\n\n- Introduces how to keep an HWHS educator as the final signer on every AI-assisted artifact in HWHS-relevant language\n- Draws an ATLAS-aligned parallel to something you already teach\n- Ends with a \'Try this Wednesday\' CTM step\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(92,'F1.6','classroom','Try a first prompt inside Google Docs','Open a Google Doc. Use the Gemini side panel (Help me write). Ask it to draft a 3-sentence email to families about an upcoming DFA window — no student names, warm HWHS tone. Compare Gemini\'s draft to what you\'d write yourself.','[]','**Gemini · DFA Family Note**\n\n- Warm greeting anchored in \'Learning today. LEADING tomorrow.\'\n- Names the DFA window and the make-up date\n- Ends with a 24-hour response promise (WIG 1)\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(93,'F1.6','classroom','Ask Gemini to explain its own limits','Ask Gemini: \'What are 5 things you should NOT be trusted to do in a Helena West Helena Schools classroom without a teacher checking your work?\' Paste the reply into your CTM notes.','[]','**Gemini · Self-Reported Limits**\n\n- Hallucinated citations\n- Standards-alignment errors on Arkansas ATLAS codes\n- Bias in reading-level judgments\n- Anything requiring current student data\n- IEP-specific decisions without special-ed review\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,2,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(94,'F1.6','coach','Draft a CTM Wednesday intro to Gemini','Draft a 10-minute CTM Wednesday opener that introduces Gemini to your team using the 4-element fidelity rubric as the frame (Agenda Monday 5 pm · CFA on schedule · DuFour 4 Qs · Tier 2/3 closure before next CFA). Use Gemini to generate the opener, then edit it in your own voice.','[]','**Gemini · CTM Opener**\n\n- Frames AI as a 4-element accelerator, not a replacement\n- Assigns each teacher one Gemini task before next Wednesday\n- Closes with a Tier 2/3 anchor\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,3,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(95,'F1.6','coach','Prompt library seed','Ask Gemini to generate 8 starter prompts an HWHS coach can hand teachers this week, one per HITS domain, each ending with a CFA-facing action.','[]','**HWHS Coach · 8 Starter Prompts**\n\n- One prompt per HITS domain\n- Each ends with a CFA-facing action\n- None reference student PII\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,4,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(96,'F1.6','coach','Observation lens for Gemini use','Draft a 5-item walkthrough lens for observing a teacher\'s first Gemini-supported lesson at HWHS. Anchor items to the Academic Playbook, not to the tool.','[]','**HWHS Walkthrough Lens · Gemini v1**\n\n- Is the standard the star, or is the tool the star?\n- Where did the teacher edit Gemini\'s output?\n- Any PII exposure risk observed?\n- How was student thinking still visible?\n- Where does this show up on the next CFA?\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,5,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(97,'F1.6','higher_ed','Cabinet baseline briefing','Ask Gemini to draft a 1-page Cabinet briefing on \'What Gemini is, what it is not, and how it will show up in HWHS this year.\' The briefing must reference the three WIGs and the scorecard\'s FERPA posture. Edit to Superintendent voice before circulating.','[]','**Cabinet Briefing · Gemini at HWHS**\n\n- Frames Gemini against the three WIGs\n- Names Google Workspace as the only sanctioned surface\n- Reinforces aggregated-only data posture\n- One decision Cabinet must make this month\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,6,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(98,'F1.6','higher_ed','Guiding Coalition talking points','Use Gemini to generate 6 talking points for the next Guiding Coalition meeting on responsible AI use across HWHS. Each talking point must tie to a specific scorecard surface — Cabinet, Principal, CTM, Board, or Public.','[]','**Guiding Coalition · Gemini Talking Points**\n\n- Cabinet surface: aggregated DFA narratives\n- Principal surface: CTM fidelity heatmap prep\n- CTM surface: DuFour 4-Q protocols\n- Board surface: one-sentence WIG updates\n- Public surface: Cougar Way in family voice\n- Every surface: FERPA discipline reminder\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,7,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(99,'F1.6','higher_ed','Central Office policy skeleton','Ask Gemini to draft a skeleton HWHS AI Acceptable Use Policy — sections only, no body text yet — that reflects: aggregated-only data, Google Workspace as the sanctioned surface, 24-hour response promise, and Board reporting cadence.','[]','**HWHS AI AUP · Skeleton**\n\n- Scope · Which HWHS accounts and tools\n- Data Discipline · Aggregated %/n only\n- Instructional Use · Standards first, tool second\n- Student Use · Age-banded expectations PreK–12\n- Response Cadence · 24-hour promise (WIG 1)\n- Review · Board update cadence\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,8,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(100,'F1.6','leader','Principal walkthrough note','Draft a note from a principal to staff introducing Gemini for the semester. Reference the school\'s 30-Day Plan cycle and the CTM Wednesday cadence. No individual staff names.','[]','**Principal · Semester Note on Gemini**\n\n- Anchored to the school\'s 30-Day Plan\n- Names CTM Wednesday as the on-ramp\n- Sets the aggregated-only expectation\n- Opens the door for coach-supported practice\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,9,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(101,'F1.6','leader','30-Day Plan alignment','Ask Gemini to draft a 30-Day Plan Reset for a principal that names one Gemini-supported action per WIG. Reset must include \'if-we-hit / if-we-miss\' language.','[]','**Principal · 30-Day Reset with Gemini**\n\n- WIG 1 · Family comms tightened to 24 hours\n- WIG 2 · CTM agendas drafted in Gemini, edited by leads\n- WIG 3 · CFA drafts pre-checked against DFA blueprints\n- If-we-hit: expand to a second grade band\n- If-we-miss: coach shadowing on Wednesdays\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,10,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
(102,'F1.6','leader','Faculty meeting deck','Ask Gemini to outline a 20-minute faculty meeting on \'Gemini and the Cougar Way\' — 3 slides on why, 3 slides on how, 1 slide on the FERPA posture.','[]','**Faculty Meeting · Gemini and the Cougar Way**\n\n- Why: mission line and WIGs\n- How: Google Workspace surfaces\n- How: CTM Wednesday practice\n- How: Academic Playbook alignment\n- FERPA: aggregated-only or nothing\n- Close: one commitment card per teacher\n\n_Reminder: Gemini output is a first draft. A Helena West Helena Schools educator is still the final signer. Do not paste student names or raw scores into any AI tool — aggregated %/n only, matching the scorecard\'s FERPA posture._','[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,11,'2026-07-07 01:50:09','2026-07-07 01:50:09'),
